                    "text": "Je coûte {2} de moins s'il y a au moins trois statistiques de base 0 parmi les Personnages que vous contrôlez.",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "I cost {2} less if there are three or more base statistics of 0 among Characters you control.",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "Costo {2} in meno se ci sono tre o più statistiche base pari a 0 tra i personaggi che controlli.",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Cuesto {2} menos si hay tres o más estadísticas básicas de 0 entre los personajes que controles.",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  }
                },
                "text": "I cost {2} less if there are three or more base statistics of 0 among Characters you control."
